### ==========================================
### 系统集成 API 测试
### ==========================================

### 0. 获取 Token（管理员）
# @name login
POST http://localhost:18081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "XiyuAdmin2026!"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 1. 正常流程：获取集成配置
GET http://localhost:18081/api/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. 正常流程：保存集成配置
PUT http://localhost:18081/api/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "integrationConfig": {
    "wecomCorpId": "ww_test",
    "wecomAgentId": "1000001",
    "wecomSecret": "test_secret",
    "orgEnabled": false
  }
}

### 3. 正常流程：审计日志列表
GET http://localhost:18081/api/audit?page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 正常流程：审计日志搜索
GET http://localhost:18081/api/audit?keyword=登录&page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 正常流程：审计日志按模块筛选
GET http://localhost:18081/api/audit?module=PROJECT&page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 正常流程：个人操作日志
GET http://localhost:18081/api/audit/my?page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 边界：非 auditor 访问审计日志
# @name staffLogin
POST http://localhost:18081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "xiaowang",
  "password": "123456"
}

@staffToken = {{staffLogin.response.body.data.token}}

GET http://localhost:18081/api/audit?page=0&size=1
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 8. 正常流程：通知列表
GET http://localhost:18081/api/notifications?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 正常流程：未读通知数
GET http://localhost:18081/api/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. 边界：空审计日志日期范围
GET http://localhost:18081/api/audit?startDate=2099-01-01&endDate=2099-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==========================================
### 接口六：项目修改（接口规范 v3.12 §3.6，X-API-Key 认证）
### PUT /api/integration/projects/{sourceSystem}/{tenderId}
### 定位键：tenderId = 平台标讯主键（取自"推送标讯"接口响应中的标讯 id），
###          非数字值（如商机编号 CC...）在路径绑定阶段即被拒绝（400）。
### 语义：按 (sourceSystem, tenderId) 定位标讯关联项目；仅写项目数据，不修改标讯字段；
###       非 null 字段覆盖、null/未传保留；evaluationCustomerInfos 传入即全量替换；
###       标讯尚未立项时返回 200 + applied=false（跳过语义，无需重试）。
### ==========================================

@apiKey = {{crmApiKey}}

### 11. 正常流程：项目全量更新（项目名称 + 投标信息 + GAP 附件 + 客户信息表含 TEL）
PUT http://localhost:18081/api/integration/projects/CRM/928
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectName": "某单位 2026 年度办公用品集中采购项目",
  "evaluationBasic": {
    "mroOfficeFlowAmount": 1200.5,
    "customerRevenue": 88,
    "riskAssessment": "招标文件存在资质门槛风险",
    "contingencyPlan": "已准备联合体投标兜底方案",
    "processKnowledge": "熟悉评标全流程，可提前准备澄清材料",
    "supportNotes": "需要总部提供历史业绩支撑",
    "projectPlanGapFiles": [
      { "fileName": "项目方案.pdf", "fileUrl": "https://crm.example.com/files/plan.pdf" }
    ]
  },
  "evaluationCustomerInfos": [
    {
      "NAME": "张三",
      "CONTACT": "13800138000",
      "TEL": "021-62345678",
      "POSITION": "采购部主任",
      "XIYU_CONTACT": "李四",
      "CONTACTED": "是",
      "CONTACT_METHOD": "电话",
      "TENDENCY": "支持",
      "INFO_TENDENCY_BASIS": "历史合作良好",
      "GUIDED_BID": "否",
      "CAN_GET_KEY_INFO": "是",
      "CAN_REMOVE_ADVERSE": "否",
      "CAN_SYNC_EVAL": "是",
      "INFO_CLEAR_WINNER_BID": false,
      "INFO_WIN_RATE_IMPACT": "30%"
    }
  ]
}

### 12. 正常流程：部分更新（仅改项目名称，其余字段保留）
PUT http://localhost:18081/api/integration/projects/CRM/928
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectName": "某单位 2026 年度办公用品集中采购项目（二期）"
}

### 13. 正常流程：按 projectId 优先定位（一致性断言：projectId 关联标讯必须 = 路径 tenderId）
PUT http://localhost:18081/api/integration/projects/CRM/928
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": 1,
  "evaluationBasic": {
    "riskAssessment": "按项目 ID 定位后更新风险预判"
  }
}

### 14. 边界：projectPlanGapFiles 传空数组 = 清空已有 GAP 附件（不传则保留）
PUT http://localhost:18081/api/integration/projects/CRM/928
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "evaluationBasic": {
    "projectPlanGapFiles": []
  }
}

### 15. 边界：tenderId 不存在 → 404（标讯不存在）
PUT http://localhost:18081/api/integration/projects/CRM/999999
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectName": "不会生效的更新"
}

### 16. 边界：非法请求体 → 400（参数非法）
PUT http://localhost:18081/api/integration/projects/CRM/928
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{not valid json

### 17. 边界：tenderId 误传非数字（如 CRM 商机编号）→ 400（路径绑定阶段拒绝，防 ID 维度混淆）
PUT http://localhost:18081/api/integration/projects/CRM/CC20260827846
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectName": "不会生效的更新"
}
